# Install-generated git hook shims at the repo root. Machine-specific absolute
# paths -- the active hooks live in .git/hooks (this repo does NOT set
# core.hooksPath=hooks), so these are never a tracked wiring surface. Guard
# against F-INSTALLER-TEST-POLLUTES-TRACKED-HOOKS re-committing a /tmp shim.
/hooks/pre-push
/hooks/prepare-commit-msg
/hooks/*.nwave-original

# TLC model-checker generated output (timestamped counterexample traces +
# state-graph binary indices) -- disposable, regenerated on every model-check
# run, never source. Tracking them caused repeated File Quality CI failures
# (missing-EOF-newline on binary/generated files). The hand-authored .tla/.cfg
# models in .tla-swarm-model/ stay tracked; only TLC's own runtime output is
# excluded.
.tla-swarm-model/*TTrace*
.tla-swarm-model/states/
